* {{sense|mathematics, imaginary number}} {{abbrev|mul|en:imaginary}}.
* {{sense|engineering, electric current}} {{abbrev|mul|fr:intensité du courant}}; first used by M. André-Marie Ampère.
* {{sense|computer programming, generic index}} {{abbrev|mul|en:index}}.
* {{sense|linguistics}} {{abbrev|mul|en:identity}}.

